    <tags>brother ql-800 ql800 printer label driver hardware</tags>
    <summary>Windows printer driver for the Brother QL-800 label printer.</summary>
    <description>Installs Brother's printer driver for the QL-800 label printer.

This package installs only the printer driver. It does not install P-touch Editor or the Printer Setting Tool. Windows on ARM is not supported by the vendor.</description>
    <releaseNotes>Packages Brother Printer Driver 1.10.1c, released 21 March 2025.</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
